      "content": "Yes, the middle falls right between 5 and 7 because an even dataset doesn't have a single middle number! \n\nTo help you remember what to do when this happens, use the **M.I.D.** mnemonic: **M**eet **I**n the **D**efinite middle, then **D**ivide by 2! \n\nUsing this rule, what do you get when you add 5 and 7 and divide by 2?"
